{"articleNo":"110646","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=110646&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[생활관]2014-2학기 생활관 룸메이트 지정 및 입사포기 환불신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.08.07","hit":"4015","attachments":[{"name":"룸메이트 사전지정 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=110646&attachNo=72800"},{"name":"생활관비 환불(퇴사)신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=110646&attachNo=72809"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\" id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2014-2학기 생활관 입사자&nbsp;룸메이트 신청 및 입사포기에 따른 환불 신청을</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">다음과 같이 안내합니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#ed0000\"><u>아래 기간 이후에는 방배정이 되어 신청이 불가하오니, 필히 정해진 기간 내에 신청해 주시기 바랍니다.</u></font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">1.신청기간 :</font>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2014.&nbsp;8. 18(월) 09:00&nbsp;~ 8. 20(수) 18:00</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">- 룸메이트 신청 대상 : 대학원생 및 외국인, 형제자매</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">- 환불 신청 대상 : 2014-2학기 생활관비 납부자</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2.&nbsp;신청방법 : 행정실 방문 또는 이메일 신청</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;1) 방문 접수</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 각 관 행정실(푸름관 : 관리동 2층 204호, 오름관 : 102호)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;2) 이메일 접수</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; : 각 관 담당자에게 메일 발송</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 첨부파일의 양식 작성</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 메일 제목에 신청 내용의 간략한 키워드와 본인의 이름 반드시 명시</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;예) 2014-하계방학 룸메이트 (유관순)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">다. 메일 발송</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; *룸메이트&nbsp;신청 : <a href=\"mailto:shinks@kumoh.ac.kr\"><u><font color=\"#0000ff\">shinks@kumoh.ac.kr</font></u></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#747474\">&nbsp;(푸름관/신평관), &nbsp;</font><a href=\"mailto:cutest@kumoh.ac.kr\"><u><font color=\"#0000ff\">cutest@kumoh.ac.kr</font></u></a><font color=\"#747474\"> (오름관)</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">*환불 신청 : <a href=\"mailto:ogiogi80@kumoh.ac.kr\"><u><font color=\"#0900ff\">ogiogi80@kumoh.ac.kr</font></u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></a><font color=\"#747474\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">&nbsp;</font>(푸름관/신평관), &nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:cutest@kumoh.ac.kr\"><u><font color=\"#0000ff\">cutest@kumoh.ac.kr</font></u></a> </font><font color=\"#747474\">(오름관) </font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2014. 8. 7.</span></font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">금오공과대학교 생활관</span></font></span></span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
